#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:5
#: defdb7f7039a4caea9a08f967dcb7fe2
msgid "User Alerts for Developers"
msgstr "面向开发者的用户警报"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:7
#: 20cb5a63ab364a528772c466b96e8180
msgid ""
"A User Alert is a formal report of an ArduPilot issue that may affect the "
"safe operation of a vehicle. An \"issue\" is typically a bug report or "
"GitHub Issue. \"Safe Operation\" is the ability of a vehicle to reliably "
"respond to user commands in a timely manner AND the ability of the vehicle "
"to reliably follow commanded actions in automated flight modes."
msgstr ""
"用户警报是对可能影响飞行器安全运行的 ArduPilot 问题的正式报告。「问题」通常指漏洞报告或 GitHub "
"Issue。「安全运行」是指飞行器能够及时可靠地响应用户指令，以及在自动飞行模式下能够可靠地执行指定动作的能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:9
#: ef154388829a4c2f9102605c1bf481d4
msgid "Examples of Safe Operation issues include:"
msgstr "安全运行问题的示例包括："

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:11
#: 217a1d59dd874199bb887cd9d08d3a63
msgid "Corrupted packets in I2C bus locking up the flight controller"
msgstr "I2C 总线上的损坏数据包导致飞控锁死"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:12
#: 2a533e62a53a466db1456dd6b2b4d54b
msgid "Non-commanded disarming whilst in-flight"
msgstr "飞行途中未经指令自动上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:13
#: 4098b17ad56947a18815ba66d93a3376
msgid ""
"Malformed stored waypoint causes vehicle to fly away whilst in AUTO mode"
msgstr "存储的航点格式错误导致飞行器在 AUTO 模式下飞走"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:14
#: e340f8c5ae1b4aee8eb5f02c12150ad5
msgid "Triggering of the watchdog reset whilst in-flight"
msgstr "飞行途中触发看门狗复位"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:16
#: 11a7b660f1c14fbbaad4eef2ba87eb3a
msgid "Examples of issues which are NOT Safe Operation issues include:"
msgstr "不属于安全运行问题的示例包括："

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:18
#: f8e2b609bb6c4a10ad536b362e01ad7c
msgid "Sub-optimal parameter values that lead to poor navigation performance"
msgstr "参数值欠优导致导航性能不佳"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:19
#: 2a8f621880f74719bd0bc095012d420d
msgid "User error or misunderstanding of parameter configuration"
msgstr "用户操作失误或对参数配置理解有误"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:20
#: 0dd16d15d7ac4edc9bd33b48bfaf5c3d
msgid ""
"Issues that, if experienced, an average user would be likely to safely "
"recover from"
msgstr "发生时普通用户通常能够安全恢复的问题"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:22
#: 1c52c568ae9244d0bd738c134155b945
msgid ""
"User Alerts will only be for ArduPilot software issues. Manufacturer "
"hardware will not be included at this stage, although this may be reviewed "
"at a later date."
msgstr "用户警报仅针对 ArduPilot 软件问题。制造商硬件问题目前不在此范围内，但未来可能会重新评估。"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:24
