#: 8f94a390a2d44e19801a5be069d4611d
msgid ""
"Textual description of any mitigations that a user can take to prevent the "
"issue from occurring BEFORE a patched ArduPilot is released. Should be "
"understandable by an average user."
msgstr "在补丁版 ArduPilot 发布之前，用户可采取的任何缓解措施的文字说明，应让普通用户易于理解。"

