#: bed76b5acfea45e3ad72b41f625135cc
msgid ""
"String array of commit ID’s. For example: ``[\"23874b32c9281dja\", "
"\"w9085bqwfskjdtnu243\"]``"
msgstr "commit ID 的字符串数组。例如：``[\"23874b32c9281dja\", \"w9085bqwfskjdtnu243\"]``"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:123
#: 4bf33aaa31aa467999ec22172debfa33
msgid ""
"Commit ID of the fix (on master branch) for this Issue. Can be multiple "
"commits if the fix commits are spread among different libraries. Empty array"
" if no fix yet. If this field is not ``[]``, it is considered that the issue"
" has been fixed in master."
msgstr ""
"针对此问题的修复 commit ID（位于 master 分支）。如果修复 commit 分散在不同库中，可以有多个。尚无修复时为空数组。若此字段不为 "
"``[]``，则认为问题已在 master 中修复。"

