#: 5e74a030a5a44fbf8b599fd3c5bacbe6
msgid ""
"Date that this User Alert was resolved. \"Resolved\" in this case means a "
"patched ArduPilot version has been released for ALL affected vehicle and "
"board types, and no further edits to this User Alert are expected."
msgstr ""
"该用户警报的解决日期。此处「已解决」是指针对所有受影响飞行器和飞控板类型的 ArduPilot 补丁版本均已发布，且预计不再对该用户警报进行进一步修改。"

