"ArduPilot release which introduced the issue, if known.  Empty assumes all "
"previous versions. The dict must cover all firmwares listed in \"Affected "
"firmware\"."
msgstr "引入该问题的 ArduPilot 版本（如已知）。为空则假定所有之前的版本均受影响。字典必须涵盖「受影响固件」中列出的所有固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:145
#: c82fabebb8bc414ab18e88bcec1ad4a0
msgid "versionFixed"
msgstr "versionFixed"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:146
#: 6c165ce335e445ab93c5219448fc366e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Dict of firmware=version. For example: ``{\"copter\": \"4.0.1\", \"plane\": "
"\"4.0.5\"}``"
msgstr "固件=版本的字典。例如：``{\"copter\": \"4.0.1\", \"plane\": \"4.0.5\"}``"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:147
#: 81fbdc05aeda44f4b7e5ef9e712111c5
msgid ""
"ArduPilot release which contains fix. List must cover all firmwares listed "
"in \"Affected firmware\". It is assumed that all versions between "
"VersionFrom and this are affected by the User Alert. This field is an empty "
"if there is no fixed version yet."
msgstr ""
"包含修复的 ArduPilot 版本。列表必须涵盖「受影响固件」中的所有固件。假定从 versionFrom "
"到此版本之间的所有版本均受该用户警报影响。如尚无修复版本，此字段为空。"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:149
#: d41dd6678f9b410ab7fa652c2b50b85c
msgid "lastmodified"
msgstr "lastmodified"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:151
#: 15eca55d4fd346c3848603c3af679f21
msgid ""
"Date and time that this User Alert was modified, in ISO8601 format. This "
"field is automatically added by the CI and does not need to be manually "
"added."
msgstr "该用户警报的最后修改日期和时间，采用 ISO8601 格式。此字段由 CI 自动添加，无需手动填写。"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:154
#: 9f30711302ea4be68dd2c99a991104a1
msgid "Application Ingestion"
msgstr "应用程序数据获取"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:156
#: be9bef2d2168474b991706c09087c8c5
msgid ""
"To make application ingestion easier, there will be a generated manifest "
"file listing all user alerts. These can then be filtered by the "
"``versionFrom``, ``versionFixed``, ``affectedFirmware`` and "
"``hardwareLimited`` fields to match with the user's autopilot and display "
"any relevant user alerts."
msgstr ""
"为简化应用程序的数据获取，系统将生成一个列出所有用户警报的清单文件。可通过 "
"``versionFrom``、``versionFixed``、``affectedFirmware`` 和 ``hardwareLimited`` "
"字段进行过滤，以匹配用户的飞控并显示相关用户警报。"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:158
#: 2674bdd5734b46fb93c6dc170abac3c3
msgid ""
"There are URL's for both an example manifest (for testing purposes) and the "
"actual user alerts manifest:"
msgstr "以下是示例清单（用于测试）和实际用户警报清单的 URL："

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:160
#: f12cdc693c294176bf23b03c366d59ee
msgid ""
"URL for example User Alerts: "
"https://firmware.ardupilot.org/useralerts/examplemanifest.json"
msgstr ""
"示例用户警报 URL：https://firmware.ardupilot.org/useralerts/examplemanifest.json"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:161
#: b3eebe29b3f043f8aaf1ecb62d334a8d
msgid ""
"URL for User Alerts: https://firmware.ardupilot.org/useralerts/manifest.json"
msgstr "用户警报 URL：https://firmware.ardupilot.org/useralerts/manifest.json"

#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:163
#: 0f2cc9f49ad5427e92cab27dded21021
msgid ""
"There is also a timestamp of the last date and time that the manifests were "
"uploaded in https://firmware.ardupilot.org/useralerts/lastmodified.txt, in "
"ISO8601 format."
msgstr ""
"此外，https://firmware.ardupilot.org/useralerts/lastmodified.txt "
"还记录了清单最后上传的日期和时间戳，采用 ISO8601 格式。"
